                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;LQA inode usage becomes 0&lt;/b&gt; after MDS restart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;With files written to Tenant equal to Inode hard limit, the client end df command showing 0 Inode usage and even the lfs quota -Uh [root@ai400x3me-4142-vm01 ~]# lfs quota -Uh --lqa tenant1 /lustre/es01a/client/tenants/tenant1/
Disk usr quotas for LQA:tenant1
      Filesystem    used   bquota  blimit  bgrace   files   iquota  ilimit  igrace
/lustre/es01a/client/tenants/tenant1/  1.141T       0k  1.819T       -       0        0    2000       - &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only range for lqa-dt-&amp;lt;name&amp;gt; is stored skipping one for md.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
